# 药水的名字跟数据值怎么走。
#
# 真服上 /give 的物品堆带 NBT，NBT 里的效果由数据值决定；数据值超出
# 0..15 的时候走的是另一条路。
#
# 2026-10-21 真服实测（协议机器人在线，探针 -Bot Steve）：
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 0   -> Given [Water Bottle] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 1   -> Given [Potion of Regeneration] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 5   -> Given [Potion of Healing] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 16  -> Given [Awkward Potion] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 17  -> Given [Potion of Regeneration] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 20  -> Given [Potion of Poison] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 32  -> Given [Thick Potion] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 48  -> Given [Water Bottle] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 64  -> Given [Mundane Potion] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 80  -> Given [Awkward Potion] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 96  -> Given [Thick Potion] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 100 -> Given [Potion of Poison] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 128 -> Given [Water Bottle] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1 255 -> Given [Water Bottle] * 1 to Steve

--- console ---
say W01
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 16
say W02
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 17
say W03
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 18
say W04
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 19
say W05
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 20
say W06
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 32
say W07
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 33
say W08
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 48
say W09
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 49
say W10
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 64
say W11
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 80
say W12
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 96
say W13
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 100
say W14
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 128
say W15
give Steve minecraft:potion 1 255
say W16
give Steve minecraft:splash_potion 1 16
say W17
give Steve minecraft:tipped_arrow 1 16
say W18
